56, "reasoning", " tasks"], [1.824197, "reasoning", ", branch prediction like"], [1.843662, "reasoning", " guessing next"], [1.863573, "reasoning", " turn, caches like fast"], [1.883006, "reasoning", " storage"], [1.902079, "reasoning", ". Also"], [1.921411, "reasoning", " mention program counter"], [1.940954, "reasoning", ","], [1.960484, "reasoning", " instruction"], [1.979986, "reasoning", " fetch, decode,"], [1.99991, "reasoning", " execute, write"], [2.019126, "reasoning", " back. Maybe"], [2.038467, "reasoning", " include small"], [2.058175, "reasoning", " example: add"], [2.077396, "reasoning", " numbers"], [2.096697, "reasoning", ", if loop. Keep"], [2.116424, "reasoning", " concise"], [2.135743, "reasoning", " but thorough. Final"], [2.155274, "reasoning", " with"], [2.174913, "reasoning", " fun"], [2.194203, "reasoning", " tone.\n"], [2.194203, "content", "\n\nImagine"], [2.213449, "content", " a modern"], [2.232842, "content", " CPU as"], [2.252585, "content", " a really"], [2.271931, "content", " smart"], [2.2915, "content", ","], [2.310906, "content", " ultra"], [2.330689, "content", "-fast factory"], [2.35018, "content", "."], [2.369706, "content", " Your"], [2.389276, "content", " program"], [2.408778, "content", " is a"], [2.428127, "content", " long"], [2.447762, "content", " list of tiny"], [2.467147, "content", " instructions,"], [2.48627, "content", " like a"], [2.505838, "content", " recipe or"], [2.525307, "content", " a set of assembly"], [2.544783, "content", " steps"], [2.56423, "content", ":"], [2.583759, "content", "\n\n>"], [2.603502, "content", " “Add"], [2.62285, "content", " 3 and"], [2.642473, "content", " 5.  \n> If"], [2.661999, "content", " the result is greater"], [2.681237, "content", " than 8"], [2.700704, "content", ", go"], [2.720049, "content", " to line"], [2.739783, "content", " 10.  \n> Otherwise"], [2.759199, "content", ", go"], [2.778514, "content", " to line 12.”\n\nThe CPU"], [2.797968, "content", "’s job is to read"], [2.817267, "content", " those instructions and carry"], [2.836719, "content", " them out billions"], [2.856358, "content", " of times per"], [2.875647, "content", " second. To"], [2.895035, "content", " do that without"], [2.914749, "content", " wasting"], [2.934234, "content", " time, it uses several"], [2.9539, "content", " clever tricks: **pip"], [2.973379, "content", "el"], [2.992877, "content", "ining**, **out-of-order execution**, **"], [3.012343, "content", "branch prediction**, and **caches**.\n\n"], [3.031957, "content", "Let’s walk"], [3.051209, "content", " through them"], [3.070637, "content", ".\n\n---\n\n## 1. The"], [3.090088, "content", " CPU is not"], [3.109672, "content", " doing"], [3.129063, "content", " one thing at a time —"], [3.148721, "content", " it’s pip"], [3.168135, "content", "elining\n\nA beginner"], [3.187504, "content", " might imagine"], [3.206902, "content", " a CPU working"], [3.226352, "content", " like this:\n\n>"], [3.245774, "content", " "], [3.265311, "content", "1. Fetch instruction  \n> 2."], [3.284857, "content", " Decode instruction"], [3.304134, "content", "  \n> 3. Execute instruction"], [3.32346, "content", "  \n> 4. Store"], [3.342812, "content", " result  \n\nThat"], [3.362199, "content", " sounds simple"], [3.381722, "content", ", but it"], [3.401604, "content", "’s"], [3.421345, "content", " slow. If each"], [3.441041, "content", " step takes time"], [3.460521, "content", ", the CPU would sit"], [3.479863, "content", " idle while"], [3.49969, "content", " the"], [3.519564, "content", " next instruction"], [3.538923, "content", " waits"], [3.558509, "content", ".\n\nInstead"], [3.578103, "content", ", a"], [3.597818, "content", " CPU"], [3.617464, "content", " uses a **pipeline**,"], [3.637059, "content", " like a car"], [3.656718, "content", " wash."], [3.676196, "content", "\n\n###"], [3.696017, "content", " Car"], [3.71554, "content", " wash analogy\n\nIn"], [3.735379, "content", " a car wash:\n\n- Car"], [3.754758, "content", " "], [3.774381, "content", "1 gets"], [3.793695, "content", " so"], [3.813351, "content", "aped"], [3.832661, "content", ".\n- While"], [3.852323, "content", " Car 1 is being"], [3.871485, "content", " washed"], [3.89099, "content", ", Car 2 gets so"], [3.910236, "content", "aped.\n- While Car 2 is"], [3.929633, "content", " being washed, Car 3 gets so"], [3.949339, "content", "aped.\n- While Car 3 is"], [3.969043, "content", " being washed, Car 1"], [3.98842, "content", " gets"], [4.007757, "content", " dried.\n\nDifferent"], [4.027176, "content", " stages"], [4.046697, "content", " happen"], [4.066235, "content", " at the same time,"], [4.085923, "content", " just"], [4.105405, "content", " on"], [4.125014, "content", " different cars.\n\nA CPU"], [4.144725, "content", " pipeline works the"], [4.164293, "content", " same way:\n\n- One"], [4.184093, "content", " instruction is being"], [4.203625, "content", " fetched"], [4.223175, "content", ".\n- Another is being decoded.\n"], [4.242349, "content", "- Another is being executed.\n- Another"], [4.262248, "content", " is having"], [4.28153, "content", " its result stored"], [4.300742, "content", ".\n\nInstead"], [4.320126, "content", " of waiting"], [4.339675, "content", " for one instruction to fully"], [4.35908, "content", " finish before starting"], [4.378478, "content", " the next, the CPU keeps"], [4.398046, "content", " a"], [4.41736, "content", " steady"], [4.436556, "content", " flow"], [4.456126, "content", " moving"], [4.475838, "content", " through stages"], [4.495405, "content", ".\n\nThis"], [4.515094, "content", " is called"], [4.534876, "content", " an"], [4.55421, "content", " **instruction pipeline**.\n\nIt’s"], [4.573693, "content", " like a factory assembly"], [4.593349, "content", " line: each"], [4.612686, "content", " worker"], [4.632504, "content", " handles"], [4.652228, "content", " one stage"], [4.67136, "content", ", but many"], [4.690869, "content", " products"], [4.710538, "content", " move"], [4.730342, "content", " through at once.\n\n---\n\n##"], [4.750147, "content", " 2. Out"], [4.769658, "content", "-of-order execution: doing"], [4.789143, "content", " easy"], [4.808714, "content", " tasks early"], [4.828321, "content", "\n\nEven"], [4.848215, "content", " with"], [4.86749, "content", " a pipeline, a"], [4.887085, "content", " problem appears"], [4.906447, "content", ": instructions"], [4.926017, "content", " often"], [4.945859, "content", " depend on each other.\n\nFor example:"], [4.965172, "content", "\n\n```text\nA"], [4.984917, "content", " = 4"], [5.004443, "content", " + 5\nB = A *"], [5.024127, "content", " 2\nC"], [5.043732, "content", " = B + 1"], [5.0636, "content", "\n```\n\n`"], [5.0833, "content", "B` cannot be calculated until"], [5.103042, "content", " `A` is finished"], [5.12242, "content", ".  \n`"], [5.141954, "content", "C` cannot be calculated until `B`"], [5.161648, "content", " is finished.\n\nThat"], [5.181267, "content", "’s"], [5.201121, "content", " called"], [5.220529, "content", " a"], [5.240138, "content", " **dependency**.\n\nBut many"], [5.259802, "content", " instructions do not depend"], [5.279184, "content", " on each other. For"], [5.29895, "content", " example:\n\n```text\nA = "], [5.318598, "content", "4 + 5\nB = "], [5.338279, "content", "10 /"], [5.357959, "content", " 2\nC = A"], [5.377294, "content", " * B"], [5.396901, "content", "\n```\n\nThe"], [5.416592, "content", " CPU can calculate `B"], [5.43598, "content", "` while it"], [5.455548, "content", " waits"], [5.475057, "content", " for `A`. It doesn’t have"], [5.494864, "content", " to follow"], [5.514395, "content", " the program"], [5.534102, "content", " line"], [5.553857, "content", "-by"], [5.573366, "content", "-line strictly"], [5.592989, "content", ".\n\nThis"], [5.612381, "content", " is called **out-of-order execution**.\n\n"], [5.631842, "content", "### Grocery"], [5.651298, "content", " analogy"], [5.670845, "content", "\n\nSup"], [5.690262, "content", "pose you are"], [5.709577, "content", " making pasta"], [5.72895, "content", ".\n\nThe"], [5.74861, "content", " recipe says:\n\n1. Bo"], [5.768014, "content", "il water"], [5.787381, "content", "  \n"], [5.806843, "content", "2. Chop"], [5.826337, "content", " vegetables"], [5.845625, "content", "  \n3. Cook pasta  \n4. Mix"], [5.865101, "content", " pasta"], [5.88442, "content", " with vegetables\n\nBut"], [5.903837, "content", " you don"], [5.923349, "content", "’t have to do"], [5.942549, "content", " exactly"], [5.961955, "content", " one"], [5.981312, "content", " tiny"], [6.000996, "content", " thing at a time. While"], [6.020542, "content", " the water is boiling, you can chop"], [6.040281, "content", " vegetables. The"], [6.059838, "content", " steps"], [6.079513, "content", " are not strictly"], [6.09902, "content", " independent —"], [6.118642, "content", " you"], [6.138415, "content", " can’t mix"], [6.158263, "content", " pasta before it"], [6.177864, "content", "’s cooked — but you can do useful"], [6.197354, "content", " work in"], [6.21707, "content", " parallel.\n\nA CPU"], [6.236434, "content", " does the same thing. It"], [6.256316, "content", " looks ahead"], [6.275722, "content", ","], [6.295325, "content", " finds"], [6.315114, "content", " instructions it"], [6.334522, "content", " can safely"], [6.353842, "content", " start early"], [6.373384, "content", ", and keeps"], [6.393032, "content", " busy"], [6.412281, "content", " units"], [6.431627, "content", " working"], [6.451228, "content", ".\n\nIt’s like"], [6.47076, "content", " a kitchen where the"], [6.49017, "content", " sous"], [6.509616, "content", " chef grabs"], [6.529181, "content", " the next"], [6.548532, "content", " ingredients"], [6.56793, "content", " while the main chef"], [6.588014, "content", " is finishing"], [6.607102, "content", " a dish.\n\nBut"], [6.626568, "content", " the CPU still"], [6.646004, "content", " has to preserve"], [6.665646, "content", " the illusion"], [6.685221, "content", " that the program"], [6.704584, "content", " ran in the"], [6.723958, "content", " original order. It"], [6.743489, "content", " cannot"], [6.762895, "content", " just"], [6.782272, "content", " finish"], [6.801621, "content", " things in"], [6.82135, "content", " a crazy"], [6.840665, "content", " way and"], [6.860243, "content", " produce"], [6.879467, "content", " wrong results. So"], [6.899066, "content", " out"], [6.918548, "content", "-of-order execution is like"], [6.937958, "content", " j"], [6.957665, "content", "uggling many"], [6.977234, "content", " tasks while"], [6.996685, "content", " making"], [7.016824, "content", " sure the final answer"], [7.03671, "content", " matches"], [7.055981, "content", " what"], [7.075595, "content", " the program should"], [7.095219, "content", " have produced"], [7.115015, "content", ".\n\n---\n\n## 3. Branch"], [7.134939, "content", " prediction: guessing where"], [7.154285, "content", " the program will go next"], [7.174023, "content", "\n\nPrograms are"], [7.193771, "content", " full of decisions"], [7.213508, "content", ":\n\n```text\nif (user"], [7.23314, "content", " logged"], [7.252425, "content", " in) {\n    show"], [7.272289, "content", " dashboard\n} else"], [7.291951, "content", " {\n    show login page"], [7.311371, "content", "\n}\n```\n\nIn"], [7.330994, "content", " machine"], [7.350598, "content", " language"], [7.372486, "content", ", this"], [7.392277, "content", " becomes"], [7.41265, "content", " something"], [7.432571, "content", " like:\n\n>"], [7.452901, "content", " If"], [7.473071, "content", " condition"], [7.493373, "content", " is true, go to address"], [7.514146, "content", " 100"], [7.534111, "content", ".  \n> Otherwise"], [7.554057, "content", ", go to address 200"], [7.574195, "content", ".\n\nThe CPU has"], [7.594865, "content", " to know"], [7.61485, "content", " which instruction"], [7.634876, "content", " to fetch next. If"], 